DESCRIPTION Non-actuating governance particle for canal workload energetics, binding energyreqJ, residual ΔVt, and K,E,R triad to Phoenix hex anchors and dailyprogress rows.

FIELDS
  nodeid        string   # canal segment identifier
  windowstart   datetime
  windowend     datetime
  energy_req_j  f64      # required workload energy [J]
  energy_surplus_j f64   # surplus/tailwind energy [J]
